'''Glid Station'''<ref name="Trespass EG">{{SW|url=series/clone-wars/trespass-episode-guide|text="Trespass" Episode Guide &#124; The Clone Wars}}</ref> was a military outpost established by the [[Galactic Republic]] on the [[planet]] [[Orto Plutonia]] early in the [[Clone Wars]], at the request of the [[Pantoran Assembly|government]] of the nearby [[moon]] [[Pantora]].<ref name="Trespass" /> In [[22 BBY]]<ref name="SWGA">''[[Star Wars: Galactic Atlas]]''</ref> a [[Skirmish on Orto Plutonia|skirmish]] ensued when a [[Confederacy of Independent Systems|Separatist]] [[Separatist outpost (Orto Plutonia)|outpost]] hidden nearby antagonized the native [[Talz]], with the [[clone trooper]]s of Glid Station being caught in the middle and [[Death|dying]]. As a result, the [[Republic Military]] and [[Pantoran]]s sent forces to investigate the loss of contact, and [[One-Day War|discovered]] the Talz presence.<ref name="Trespass" />

